extends FullMedium
class_name AutoMedium

## AutoMedium - the original show with nothing to set: one scene at a time, filling the frame,
## chosen by the song's own fingerprint and cut on its beat.
##
## Draws exactly what [FullMedium] draws; what makes it a medium of its own is that it takes no
## settings (its row's `bare`). The Medium card shows only the picker, picking it resets the
## Director's dials to their defaults, and its block in a note is the medium's name alone, so the
## same song is the same show in every note. The frame is landscape: a portrait show is Full frame's.
